<TITLE>Shift Control</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>On vehicles with the U660E transaxle, a 6-Speed Sports Direct Shift (6-speed Sport Direct Shift) with paddle shift has been adopted.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>In addition to paddle shifts that allow the shift range to be changed while holding the steering wheel, M mode control has been adopted to provide driving pleasure during sporty driving.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>With the adoption of M mode control, the position for switching to Shiftmatic has been changed from "S" to "M".</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
